scene intro
  line "Naomi Freed: \"My daddy always said a free woman needs a strong arm and a stronger will. I've got both.\""
scene camp
  line "Naomi Freed: \"Nicodemus — that's where we're headed one day. A town built by us, for us. Every bullet I fire is a down payment on that dream.\""
scene camp
  line "Naomi Freed: \"I don't trust a man who won't meet my eyes. Usually means he's got something to hide, or he's scared of what he sees.\""
scene mission
  line "Naomi Freed: \"Stay close. I'll watch your back if you watch mine.\""
scene mission
  line "Naomi Freed: \"I've got your six. Move up!\""
